%% Sequence Diagram - Xoa comment tren task (ADR-026)
%% Ba nhanh quyen chong nhau: nguoi ngoai project (404), thanh vien nhung khong phai tac gia
%% va khong phai PM (403), tac gia HOAC ProjectManager (204).
%% Doi chieu: SUA comment chi tac gia — PM cung khong, vi noi dung van dung ten tac gia cu.
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Actor as Nguoi goi
participant API as CommentsController
participant Service as CommentService
participant Repo as CommentRepository
participant Authz as ProjectAuthorizationService
participant Logger as ActivityLogger
participant UoW as UnitOfWork
participant DB as Database

Actor->>API: DELETE /api/v1/comments/{id}
API->>Service: DeleteAsync(id)
Service->>Repo: GetWithTaskAsync(id)
Note over Repo,DB: Query filter !c.Task.IsDeleted da co san tu InitialCreate:<br/>comment cua task xoa mem tu bien mat, khong service nao phai nho loc
Repo->>DB: SELECT Comment + Task + Author
DB-->>Repo: row or null
Repo-->>Service: Comment or null

alt comment khong ton tai (hoac task cua no da bi xoa mem)
  Service-->>API: NotFoundException(Comment, id)
  API-->>Actor: 404 Not Found
else comment ton tai
  Note over Service,Authz: Nguong dung o day la View, khong phai action ghi:<br/>muc dich chi de loai nguoi ngoai project va LAY RA RoleInProject.<br/>Luat that nam o Service (ADR-019 - ranh gioi con lai)
  Service->>Authz: AuthorizeAsync(comment.Task.ProjectId, View)
  Authz->>DB: SELECT ProjectMembers
  DB-->>Authz: RoleInProject or null

  alt khong phai thanh vien project
    Authz-->>Service: NotFoundException(Project, projectId)
    Note over Service: Chuan hoa 404 (ADR-019): bat lai va nem<br/>NotFoundException(Comment, id) — khong de lo projectId<br/>cho nguoi ngoai
    Service-->>API: NotFoundException(Comment, id)
    API-->>Actor: 404 Not Found
  else la thanh vien project
    Authz-->>Service: RoleInProject

    alt khong phai tac gia VA khong phai ProjectManager
      Note over Service: Member/Viewer khong xoa duoc loi nguoi khac
      Service-->>API: ForbiddenException
      API-->>Actor: 403 Forbidden
    else la tac gia HOAC la ProjectManager
      Note over Service,UoW: Xoa CUNG, khong ISoftDeletable (ADR-026):<br/>nhat quan ADR-012 (go member cung xoa cung).<br/>Them co da-xoa thi moi query comment ve sau phai nho<br/>loc them mot dieu kien — dung lop loi cua ADR-008
      Service->>UoW: Comments.Remove(comment)
      Service->>Logger: Log(TaskItem, taskId, CommentDeleted, chi ro tac gia hay PM xoa)
      Note over Logger: Audit trail do ActivityLog dam nhiem thay cho soft delete
      Service->>UoW: SaveChangesAsync()
      Note over UoW: MOT lan SaveChanges cho ca xoa comment + ghi log (ADR-007)
      UoW->>DB: DELETE FROM Comments + INSERT ActivityLog
      DB-->>UoW: ok
      Service-->>API: void
      API-->>Actor: 204 No Content
    end
  end
end
